"description": "SM Energy Co. is an independent energy company, which engages in the acquisition, exploration, development, and production of oil, gas, and natural gas liquids. It is a premier, scaled operator of top-tier oil and gas assets across four U.S. shale basins: the Permian Basin, DJ Basin, South Texas, and Uinta Basin. It is focused on operational excellence, disciplined capital allocation, and delivering growing returns to stockholders. The company was founded in 1908 and is headquartered in Denver, CO.",
